  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/02/IMG_9415.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(245 fotos) Este domingo a las 19 horas, en La Cassola, se juega el segundo partido de la V Liga de Improvisaci&oacute;n Teatral de Onda entre los equipos Armadillos y Som=Rojados, despu&eacute;s de que en el primer matx The Br&oacute;colis Power (de verde) se impusiera 7-5 a Zona Azul.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9025.jpg\" alt=\"img_9025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9027.jpg\" alt=\"img_9027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9028.jpg\" alt=\"img_9028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9030.jpg\" alt=\"img_9030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9031.jpg\" alt=\"img_9031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9032.jpg\" alt=\"img_9032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9033.jpg\" alt=\"img_9033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9034.jpg\" alt=\"img_9034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/1erpartitlligaimpro17/img_9036.jpg\" alt=\"img_9036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0